<a class="fs_style_10" data-page-name="About" href="/fs/pages/420">About Us</a>

<h3><br>
Experience More in Sherman ISD</h3>
Discover more opportunities for your student<br>
<a class="fs_style_10" data-page-name="Student Experience" href="/fs/pages/2662">Student Experience</a></div><div class="fsNavPageThumbnail"><img alt="A boy looks at a robot driving across the ground." data-aspect-ratio="0.938" data-image-sizes="[{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_1/v1782940465/shermanisdnet/dbuljfsbxzpwn1towfxu/Aboutnavigationimage.jpg%22,%22width%22:256},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_2/v1782940465/shermanisdnet/dbuljfsbxzpwn1towfxu/Aboutnavigationimage.jpg%22,%22width%22:512},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_3/v1782940465/shermanisdnet/dbuljfsbxzpwn1towfxu/Aboutnavigationimage.jpg%22,%22width%22:800},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto/v1782940465/shermanisdnet/dbuljfsbxzpwn1towfxu/Aboutnavigationimage.jpg%22,%22width%22:1000}]"></div><ul class="fsNavLevel2"><li><a href="/about/our-district">Our District</a></li><li><a href="/about/district-leadership-team">District Leadership Team</a></li><li><a href="/about/district-initiatives">District Initiatives</a></li><li><a href="/about/district-committees">District Committees</a></li><li><a href="/about/bond-programs">Bond Programs</a></li><li><a href="/about/news">News &amp; Announcements</a></li><li><a href="/about/calendar">Calendar</a></li><li><a href="/about/legal-notices">Legal Notices</a></li><li><a href="/about/contact-us">Contact Us</a></li></ul></div></li><li class="fsNavParentPage"><a href="/board-of-trustees">Board of Trustees</a><div class="fsNavPageInfo"><div class="fsNavPageDescription"><h3>Meet the Board</h3>
See who serves on the Board of Trustees<br>
<a class="fs_style_10" data-page-name="Board Members" href="/fs/pages/429">Trustee Info</a>

<h3><br>
